<!--
  Android on Linux — adaptive icon FOREGROUND.

  An Android + Linux hybrid mascot: a clean white Tux (Linux penguin) silhouette
  wearing the Android robot's two diagonal antennae. Everything sits inside the
  central 72dp safe zone of the 108dp adaptive canvas (viewport 26..82 x, 18..86 y)
  so no part is clipped by any launcher mask shape.

  Palette:
    - body / antennae  : white  (#FFFFFF)        — the silhouette, reads on green bg
    - belly            : soft white (#F4FBF7)
    - eyes             : Android green-dark (#0B3D26) on small white sclera
    - beak / feet      : Android green (#3DDC84)  — ties the penguin to the brand
-->
